* Auto-generated testbench for voltage divider: R410/R441
* Expected Vout = 3.3 * 0.500000 = 1.6500 V
* Model: ideal passives (exact, unloaded)

VIN VREF_ 0 DC 3.3
R410 VREF_ OPP_U1 56k
R441 OPP_U1 0 56k

.control
op 
let vout_sim = v(OPP_U1)
let error_pct = abs(vout_sim - 1.65) / 1.65 * 100
echo "vout_sim=$&vout_sim error_pct=$&error_pct expected=1.65" > /Users/dionlava/Documents/GitHub/ShiroDrive/ShiroFOC/ShiroFOC_KiCad_P1/outputs/routing_P1/spice_ngspice_work/voltage-divider_R410_R441.out
quit
.endc

.end
